grab-cookie
===========

`scripts/credstore.py` is a copy of the credential-store backend from the
sibling `connect-tool` Skill in this repository:

    skills/connect-tool/scripts/credstore.py
    Copyright (c) Servosity, Inc.  Author: Damien Stevens.
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The only change from that file is the credential-store namespace in
`target_name()`: `grab-cookie/<service>/<account>` instead of
`Servosity/connect-tool/<service>/<account>`, so the two Skills do not write
over each other's entries in the OS credential store.

`scripts/ctplatform.py` is a minimal shim providing the single `WINDOWS` flag
that `credstore.py` imports. The `connect-tool` module of the same name also
carries browser and process helpers that this Skill does not use, so only the
flag is shipped here.

Maintainers: if you would rather these two Skills share one copy of
`credstore.py` than carry near-duplicates, say so on the pull request and it
will be reworked. The duplicate is here only so the Skill stays self-contained
for a plugin install.

